{"type":"reasoning","timestamp":1788503479300,"sessionID":"ses_f94e4d0f6ffeQOYRYclieGJzVe","part":{"id":"prt_06b1cd90f001k9J5XF1i43EumN","messageID":"msg_06b1cbf0d001D30Xx01X3UiInl","sessionID":"ses_f94e4d0f6ffeQOYRYclieGJzVe","type":"reasoning","text":"Now let me write the test file `tests/realtime/test_session.py`. I'll cover:\n\n1. `test_function_call_handled_inline` - tool call processed in the main flow (no background task created; session has no `_background_task` attribute; ToolStart/ToolEnd events emitted synchronously)\n2. `test_get_new_history_is_classmethod` - the method can be called as a class method\n3. `test_history_update_on_audio_transcription` - replacing existing items (transcript merged into placeholder)\n4. `test_get_new_history_inserts_at_position` - insertion based on previous_item_id\n5. `test_close_does_not_cancel_background_tasks` - close just removes listener and closes model\n\nLet me check how the `@function_tool` decorator works for creating a FunctionTool for the test.","time":{"start":1788503447823,"end":1788503479293},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Now let me write the test file `tests/realtime/test_session.py`. I'll cover:\n\n1. `test_function_call_handled_inline` - tool call processed in the main flow (no background task created; session has no `_background_task` attribute; ToolStart/ToolEnd events emitted synchronously)\n2. `test_get_new_history_is_classmethod` - the method can be called as a class method\n3. `test_history_update_on_audio_transcription` - replacing existing items (transcript merged into placeholder)\n4. `test_get_new_history_inserts_at_position` - insertion based on previous_item_id\n5. `test_close_does_not_cancel_background_tasks` - close just removes listener and closes model\n\nLet me check how the `@function_tool` decorator works for creating a FunctionTool for the test.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}}}}
